Gene IGHV1-8
============

Known germline alleles:

- 3 known alleles: IGHV1-8*01, IGHV1-8*02, IGHV1-8*03
- Common length: 296 nucleotides
- Nucleotide positions where differences are found: 93, 210

    pos            30  93  210
    ----------     --  --  ---
    IGHV1-8*01      G   T    G
    IGHV1-8*02      G   C    G
    IGHV1-8*03      G   C    T

Made-up germline alleles:

- 2 made-up novel alleles: IGHV1-8*fake1, IGHV1-8*fake2
- Common length: 296 nucleotides
- They differ from alleles *01, *02, *03 at positions 30, 93 and/or 210:

    pos            30  93  210
    -------------  --  --  ---
    IGHV1-8*fake1   A   C    G
    IGHV1-8*fake2   A   T    G


Gene IGHV4-61
=============

Known germline alleles:

- 13 known alleles reported by IMGT and AIRR.

- The 5 known alleles reported by AIRR are:
    o IGHV4-61*01, IGHV4-61*02: 299 nucleotides
    o IGHV4-61*10, IGHV4-61*11, IGHV4-61*i04: 298 nucleotides

- Nucleotide positions where differences are found: 38, 45-46, 85, 127, 129,
  154-155, 163-164, 213, 267, 270, 299

  pos           38  45-46  85  127  129  154-155  163-164  213  267  270  299
  ------------  --  -----  --  ---  ---  -------  -------  ---  ---  ---  ---
  IGHV4-61*01    A     GG   G    C    A       TA       TA    A    T    G    A
  IGHV4-61*02    A     AC   A    G    C       CG       AC    A    C    A    A
  IGHV4-61*10    A     GG   G    G    C       TA       TA    A    T    G    -
  IGHV4-61*11    A     AC   A    G    C       CG       AC    G    C    A    -
  IGHV4-61*i04   G     GG   G    C    A       TA       TA    A    T    G    -

Made-up germline allele:

- 1 made-up novel allele: IGHV4-61*fake
- Length: 302 nucleotides
- Same as IGHV4-61*02 but with 3 nucleotides (CAT) inserted between
  positions 11 and 12.

